{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"成立。H1 已建立“那句话留在心里”是为了珍惜眼下自在，因此“那句话安静地留着”之后更敢沉入亲近、比先前轻松，有明确的历史承接，不是凭空补前史；S02-B1 的贴近与无须找话题支持“享受对方的亲近”，S02-B4 的“因为太喜欢眼前的东西，所以尚未失去便舍不得”支持“想多待一会儿、心里发热”，而 S02-B2/B4 已明确写出水一直流、时间一直走以及希望这一刻慢一点，足以给“为时间正在过去而发酸”提供具体原因。解释形成了‘保留那句话以维持自在→更能享受亲近；越喜欢此刻→越想停留，而时间仍在走→发酸’的因果链，不只是宣布感受。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S02-B2：尚未解释左手心跳/水浪般持续摇动，以及放弃踩实地面、把身体交给托举的漂浮和失重感。\",\"S02-B5：尚未解释第12–14小节感情突然上涌、呼吸改变，以及随后没有冲向高潮而呼气般落回柔和、心事仍未说死的段内变化。\",\"S02-B1：虽已覆盖亲近与自在，但未具体解释两条歌声贴得极近的耳语感，以及潮湿温热、略黏稠的肌肤触感。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a08cf4f9-3ab6-4d76-9ba5-000f546e030e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045520826058Z", "elapsed_seconds": 12.203, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:33.033574+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4ec06da4eb6358ceba1ac46a27a506513016dfe69b480d43a23e90ce40d6a17a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a